# fresh per #273).
#
# Probe (2026-10-02-2-probe.play) found today's actual run is The
# Bloodgorged, 25-player heroic, HASTENED. First priest:discipline session
# this job has ever run in mode=daily. Also the first HASTENED daily on a
# boss other than The Skyward Deck since direction.md's "Not yet filed"
# section flagged a source-confirmed enrage-countdown bug there (hud.ts:1572
# and combat.ts:947-952 both read the raw, un-affixed encounter.enrage
# instead of boss.ts's affix-adjusted enrageAt) and explicitly asked for a
# different boss to confirm it is not Skyward-Deck-specific. The Bloodgorged's
# own enrage is 240s (src/sim/encounters.ts) and affixEnrage('hastened') is
# 135s (src/sim/affix.ts), so the real enrage attaches at s.time=105 -- the
# script runs well past that point to read the minimap countdown on both
# sides of it.
